    "previous_id": 0,
    "previous_guid": null,
    "section": "<p>Reagents, Solutions and Materials prepared in advance:</p>",
    "section_color": "#A492FF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "a) **Pre-cool **blunt 200 \u00b5l pipette tips (Fisher 02-707-134).\nb) **Pre-warm **multi-well TC plate (this protocol uses 24-well TC plate, cat# 3526, Costar) and Stem Pro Accutase (Gibco, Cat # A11105-01) supplemented with 10 \u00b5M Y-27632 (Sigma, Y0503-1MG; 100 \u00d7 dilution from stock solution, this is Rock inhibitor used to prevent the stem cells from anoikis during the passaging process).\nc) **Pre-thaw **Matrigel (Corning 356231)on the ice for at least 2 hrs, we usually thaw it o/n on the ice.\nd) **Prepare **20% (vol/vol) FBS medium and basal media as needed.",
    "data": null,
